{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mood Note – Photo Diary 是一款專為重視隱私的用戶而設的日記應用，提供安全的鎖定功能，讓你可以放心記錄內心想法與個人回憶。目前正在進行終生版限時免費活動，原價 US $8.99 的 Premium 內購現可免費領取。</p>\n\n<h2>安全鎖定與簡潔體驗</h2>\n<p>這款應用內建強大的鎖定機制，有效防止他人窺探你的私密內容。介面設計簡潔直觀，方便你快速書寫與回顧。同時支援圖片日記功能，讓你的每一個回憶都能搭配照片保存。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-43-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-44-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-45-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-46-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-47-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-48-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Mood Note – Photo Diary 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mood Note – Photo Diary</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T16:07:00.129562+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}